Scope note

This license covers the work of this repository's author: the reader
application under src/, the content pipeline under pipeline/, and the Hebrew
layer under public/content/ (translations, code walkthroughs, exercises and
glossary).

It does not cover the underlying course material — the lesson pages, figures
and interpreter source files of Ben-Gurion University's "Principles of
Programming Languages" course, which are redistributed here under their own MIT
License, Copyright (c) 2021-2023 Michael Elhadad. See NOTICE.md for the full
attribution and license text.
